# Normalize line endings.
#
# Every text file is stored with LF endings in the repository and checked out
# with LF endings, on every platform. This keeps the working tree free of
# spurious "modified" entries that only differ by CRLF/LF, and it keeps
# shell scripts (scripts/demo.sh, CI workflows) executable as-is.
#
# Binary files (PNGs under docs/diagrams/assets) are detected automatically by
# git and are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
